1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
QuranGuard — A Quran Citation Auditor for Chrome

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Millions of Islamic articles cite Quran verses — but errors are common

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Wrong verse text, wrong reference numbers, corrupted wording...

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,000
QuranGuard detects and fixes all of them, automatically

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Click the QuranGuard icon to open the extension

6
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:50,000
Click "فحص الصفحة" (Scan Page) to audit every citation

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The extension scans every Quranic citation on the page

8
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:15,000
Results appear as colored highlights directly on the text

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:28,000
GREEN — Citation is correct, reference verified ✓

10
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:36,000
LIGHT BLUE — Text matches Quran but no reference was cited

11
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:44,000
YELLOW — Word-level mismatch between cited text and the mushaf

12
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:52,000
ORANGE — Text is correct but the cited reference is wrong

13
00:01:52,500 --> 00:02:00,000
RED — Text was not found in the Quran at all

14
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Click any highlight to see the details and the authentic mushaf text

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:28,000
The results panel appears on the side — all findings at a glance

16
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:36,000
Filter by category, jump to any finding, or copy the details

17
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Click "تصحيح في المكان" (Correct in Place) to replace with the authentic text

18
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:56,000
The highlight turns light green — correction applied and logged

19
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:08,000
The panel gives you full control over what's displayed

20
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:16,000
Toggle each color category on or off

21
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:24,000
Switch between highlight mode, underline mode, or turn off visuals entirely

22
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:32,000
Enable Quran fonts to display authentic Uthmani script styling

23
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Open Settings (⚙ الإعدادات) for persistent preferences

24
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:54,000
Choose your language, default font, highlight behavior, and more

25
00:03:54,500 --> 00:04:02,000
Autocomplete settings control how the writer-side feature behaves

26
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:16,000
The writer-side feature works on any website where you type text

27
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:24,000
As you type a Quranic citation, QuranGuard suggests the authentic text

28
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:32,000
Works on any text input — blogs, CMS editors, comment boxes, email

29
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Press Tab or Enter to accept the suggestion

30
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:48,000
The authentic Uthmani wording is inserted — correctly, every time

31
00:04:53,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Six themes — choose the look that fits your browser

32
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:06,000
Default · Mihrab · Atelier · Diwan · Marakeb · Tahrir

33
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:18,000
QuranGuard — protecting Quranic integrity, one citation at a time

34
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:24,000
Available on the Chrome Web Store
